  "abstract": "Spectrum-Adaptive Projection (SAP) on LN-SSM: learn gates over projection columns with L1 sparsity (\u03b1=8e\u22125) to adapt effective rank. Base: Oscillatory 2nd-order SSM in factor space + increment MLP + residual copy + gamma. Export gate stats for analysis.",
